{
  "_comment": [
    "Letters: where each record's source lives and what may be shown of it, keyed by the L3VLUP record slug",
    "(data/letters.catalogue.json in the site repo). Read by scripts/letters-thumbnails.mjs.",
    "",
    "sourceUrl is the immutable source of record. letterRoute says where the letter starts in it. renderPage is",
    "the page a preview is taken from, and lastPage the last page of the letter (the photo guard may move on to",
    "the next page, never past it). crop is an optional hint: top, left, right (the card window, in fractions);",
    "half ('left' or 'right' page of a two-page spread) or region ({left, top, right, bottom} fractions of the page:",
    "the detail is the region, the card a window in it, and the preview stays on renderPage); above (HTML only: the",
    "share of a viewport shown above the letter's route). A half, region or above needs a reason and a reviewBy date.",
    "guardOverride (graphics-not-photographs only) needs a guardNote and a guardReviewBy date, and lifts the photo",
    "guard's page limit for that record's detail image alone.",
    "",
    "rights: sec-public (a public SEC filing: a preview of the letter page is allowed, credited and linked),",
    "first-party-link-only, or first-party-restrictive (identity cover only: nothing is fetched, rendered or kept).",
    "thumbnailMode: source-preview, identity-cover or disabled. takedown: true withdraws a preview at the next run,",
    "whatever the mode says. Edit this file, not the script."
  ],
  "version": 1,
